@title Payments Weekly Status
@subtitle Week of Oct 12 to Oct 16, 2026
@author Priya Raman, Engineering Manager, Payments
@date 2026-10-16
@width wide

Five of seven sprint commitments shipped and authorization success hit a six-week high. Two items slipped: EU acquirer routing (blocked on partner certificates) and ledger reconciliation v2. The chargeback rate is above its 0.50% ceiling for the second week running, and that is the risk I most want your attention on.

kpi Auth success rate | 98.7% | +0.3 pts | good
kpi p99 checkout latency | 412 ms | -9% | good
kpi Chargeback rate | 0.61% | +0.07 pts | bad
kpi Sprint commitments done | 71% | 5 of 7 | bar

