## Decisions needed from you

1. A call to the acquirer's regional head by Oct 21 to ask for priority on the EU certificates. This is the only thing that protects the Nov 1 pilot date.
2. Approval for one contractor for 6 weeks ($38,000) to cover Mei's absence and the ledger v2 backlog.
3. Agreement that if chargebacks reach 0.65% before Oct 30, we pause new-merchant onboarding until the rate is back under 0.55%.
